    "description": "<p>You mold and shape small stones into the shape of shuriken. When you do, you autonomously Fire them all off, one after another like bullets pelting and tearing through enemies.</p>\n<p>Make a ranged ninjutsu attack. On a hit, you deal 4d6 earth damage, reducing the affected creatures movement speed by -10.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d6 and the speed penalty by -5.</p>",
